      "type": "guide",
      "title": "Psychology Midterm Study Guide",
      "content": "# Psychology Midterm Study Guide\n\n## Chapter 1: History\n- Wundt's laboratory (1879)\n- Schools of thought: structuralism, functionalism, behaviorism\n- Modern perspectives: cognitive, biological, social\n\n## Chapter 2: Research Methods\n- Scientific method steps\n- Variable types\n- Experimental vs correlational studies\n\n## Key Terms to Know\n- Independent variable\n- Dependent variable\n- Control group\n- Random assignment",
